'''Blackthorn's Camp''' is a [[Horde]]-aligned outpost located on the shores of western [[Gilneas]]. Led by the banshee-possessed bandit lord [[Blackthorn]], the bandit gang was sent to Gilneas to survey the situation, acquire assets for the Horde, and evaluate whether the area is suitable for exploitation by the Forsaken.<ref>{{questlong|Horde|41|To Gilneas}}</ref>

